<title>AUSTRALIA: GMA plans A$21.6 mln converting note issue.</title>
<headline>GMA plans A$21.6 mln converting note issue.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold Mines of Australia Ltd (GMA) announced on Thursday plans to raise A$21.6 million through the issue of 20.6 million renounceable converting notes at A$1.05 a note.</p>
</text>
